@startuml SEQ_02_MENGELOLA_JADWAL_PIKET
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-02: Mengelola Jadwal Piket

actor       "Admin"                 as Admin
boundary    "Browser"               as Browser
control     "JadwalPiketController" as Controller
entity      "JadwalPiket Model"     as Model
entity      "User Model"            as ModelUser

== Lihat Jadwal==

Admin   -> Browser     : Buka menu Jadwal Piket
Browser --> Admin : response / redirect
Browser -> Controller  : GET /piket/jadwal
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> Model    : Query jadwal berdasarkan kepengurusan lab
Model --> Controller   : Data jadwal
Controller -> ModelUser : Query daftar asisten di lab
ModelUser --> Controller : Data asisten
Controller --> Browser  : Render halaman jadwal piket
Browser --> Admin       : Tampil matriks Hari x Asisten + dropdown assign

== Assign Asisten ke Slot Hari ==

Admin   -> Browser     : Pilih asisten + pilih hari, klik "Simpan"
Browser --> Admin : response / redirect
Browser -> Controller  : POST /piket/jadwal {user_id, hari, kepengurusan_lab_id}
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> Model    : create({user_id, hari, kepengurusan_lab_id})
Model --> Controller   : Data jadwal baru
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser --> Admin      : Jadwal berhasil ditambahkan

== Hapus Jadwal Asisten ==

Admin   -> Browser     : Klik ikon hapus pada slot asisten
Browser --> Admin : response / redirect
Browser -> Controller  : DELETE /piket/jadwal/{id}
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> Model    : Query jadwal
Model --> Controller   : Data jadwal
Controller -> Model    : delete()
Model --> Controller : Hasil proses
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser --> Admin      : Jadwal berhasil dihapus

@enduml